    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Rasra Ballia | Safe Enclosed Car Shipping
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee that my car will not get scratched during transport from Rasra Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We use fully enclosed, climate‑controlled carriers equipped with 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging and wheel‑belt anchoring. Each vehicle is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and our drivers follow a strict zero‑scratch protocol verified by live GPS monitoring, ensuring pristine delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to arrange Car Transportation In Rasra Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed transport agreement, and a copy of your insurance policy (if you prefer personal coverage). For corporate moves, GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills are also accepted.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle live while it travels the 850 km route from Rasra Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our satellite‑based GPS system provides real‑time location updates accessible via a secure client portal. You’ll receive instant alerts for key milestones—pickup, en‑route checkpoints, and doorstep delivery—so you stay informed throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the car transport fully insured and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards up to the declared value of your vehicle. In the unlikely event of a claim, we handle documentation and settlement swiftly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transportation from Rasra Ballia to major hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time for the 850 km corridor is 2‑3 business days, depending on traffic, weather conditions, and any required customs or toll clearances. Our optimized routing and dedicated multi‑axle express freight lanes help maintain punctual deliveries.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for vehicles shipped from Rasra Ballia?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet includes 18‑ft, 22‑ft, and 32‑ft MX containers, accommodating everything from compact hatchbacks to full‑size SUVs and luxury cars. Vehicles exceeding 2,500 kg or with unusually long wheelbases are assigned to specialized multi‑car trailers with reinforced axles.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system work and is it safe for high‑value cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp lowers smoothly onto the carrier floor, allowing drivers to drive the vehicle onto the platform under controlled speed. Once positioned, wheel‑belt anchors lock the car in place. This method eliminates manual lifting, reducing risk and ensuring safe transport for premium and classic cars.</p>
      </div>
